{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":86,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1885062,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1422959902,"LastPoster":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1885062,"PostDate":1422959902,"PostContent":"Hi Everyone, \u00a0 so after a brief discussion with some friends, they suggested we look into the pri...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alison.hardy1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422345923,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hardyali","Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"120d4653a6e826806b9fb16a0b954d20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;so after a brief discussion with some friends, they suggested we look into the price difference for early Feb 2016 ( say the 6th-13th), vs end of Feb\/March (27th-7thish)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know if it&#039;d be cheaper to go in early feb, as to very beginning of march?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885062,"PostDate":1422959902,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>so after a brief discussion with some friends, they suggested we look into the price difference for early Feb 2016 ( say the 6th-13th), vs end of Feb\/March (27th-7thish)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone know if it'd be cheaper to go in early feb, as to very beginning of march?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alison.hardy1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.99.65.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422345923,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281894.jpg?_r=1422907392","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hardyali","Id":281894,"Name":"hardyali","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.89.236.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0531de69bf320423adb23a377301d004","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;A good travel agent will be able to help you out with advice.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885088,"PostDate":1422970840,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>A good travel agent will be able to help you out with advice.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"njwood000@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.7.173.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405795991,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Msmimi","Id":279087,"Name":"Msmimi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78727,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00528a493427ae925ae310b7b1c6a7f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Usually the room rates will be very similar but there are variables that can affect pricing mainly occupancy levels. &amp;nbsp;Another thing to consider is that for group blocks, there might be blackout dates that exclude any group amenities.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It really is best to contact a destination wedding specialist to get pricing and group amenities to you. &amp;nbsp;We have a few DR specialists on board and you can read our reviews and contact us via my siggy.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885138,"PostDate":1422998037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Usually the room rates will be very similar but there are variables that can affect pricing mainly occupancy levels. \u00a0Another thing to consider is that for group blocks, there might be blackout dates that exclude any group amenities.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It really is best to contact a destination wedding specialist to get pricing and group amenities to you. \u00a0We have a few DR specialists on board and you can read our reviews and contact us via my siggy.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com<\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/75243-karisma-diamond-level-5\/\" title=\"Karisma Diamond Level 5\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_8442\/sml_gallery_206696_8442_4984.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Karisma Diamond Level 5'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Karisma Diamond Level 5' id='sml_image_view_75243' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/77453-pro-palace-specialist-agent-platinum-sm\/\" title=\"PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_2474.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm'  width='200' height='118'  alt='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm' id='sml_image_view_77453' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137195420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78727","Title":"Help! When To Go","LastPostDate":1422998037},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
